      "leaf_matches": [
        {
          "slug": "typeface-design-application",
          "reason": "四项定义性属性逐条落到官方正文段落（帮助站 HTML 快照的 div.vp-doc 内正文，并以官方 Help 仓库 markdown 原文复核）：(1) 持久字体项目——open-project.md「Start a new Glyphr Studio project…Just provide a project name and a default project will be created」「Auto-save is enabled by default…saved to your browser's local storage…Restore tab shows a list of these auto-saved projects」，import-export.md「The Glyphr Studio Project file contains all the information about your project, including metadata and glyph outlines」「.gs2 file suffix」；(2) 带字符映射的字形集——characters.md「Code point…is also how Glyphr Studio identifies characters in a project」「you can enable any range of characters you want (the default is the 'Basic Latin' character range)」与 features.md「Editing any character in Unicode…Planes 0 through 3…have range names and can be searched for and added」；(3) 在字体自身几何上直接绘制——editing.md「New Path…Click and drag to add a point with symmetric handles」「Path edit…move that point or move it's handles」「Zoom 1:1…1 pixel on your screen is equal to 1 Em unit from your project」「add in Left and Right Side Bearings to give the imported shape an overall Advance Width」，import-export.md 元数据表列出 unitsPerEm/ascender/descender；(4) 生成可用字体文件——import-export.md「can export your project as a font file in four formats: .otf, .ttf, .woff, and .woff2」，features.md 支持格式清单，首页「Export fonts / Generate ready-to-use font files straight from your browser」。服务形态：首页与 README 明确 100% in-browser、免注册、静态构建无后端。边界：features.md 列出不支持彩色字体、可变字体、多母版/插值、RTL、垂直排版、上下文/样式替代与 OpenType 特性。六份 help HTML 快照经复核确实内嵌上述正文（此前初审判断其为纯外壳不成立），markdown 原文另存以便直接核对。",
